  "description": "\"Are you really my dad’s friend’s son?\"\n\nOne day, Jutae ends up living with Suhan, his father’s old college friend’s son.\nJutae can’t help but feel uneasy and irritated by Suhan’s friendly, easygoing nature.\nTo make things worse, Jutae’s father, Jaeheon, seems unusually concerned about the relationship between the two.\nThus begins a suspicious cohabitation among three men.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_fang_wz), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4898510), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1286003166), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/venomous_tooth), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/xiumin_162)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/fang)",
